;; TEAM-SOLVE: the manager loop from GVS5H (Lee 2026), as a samizdat manifest.
;; Each role is a fresh context and the ledger is the run's journal.
;;
;;   start -> plan -> ideate -> manage -+-> work -> test -> manage
;;                                      +-> unstick -+-> work
;;                                      |            +-> verify
;;                                      +-> verify -> finish
;;
;;   plan     one call: PLAN and TASKS
;;   ideate   independent calls from different technique families; no code
;;   manage   one call, then the mechanical rules: a failing check cannot be
;;            done, the same task twice is stuck, rounds are bounded
;;   work     one worker on one task, in a fresh context
;;   test     a script decides: the samples, the verify command, or nothing
;;   unstick  ask the supervisor and wait, bounded; then try something different
;;   verify   the strict rerun, restoring the last passing work if needed
{:description "Solve a task as a team of fresh contexts coordinated by a manager: plan, independent ideation from different techniques, then rounds of one worker task followed by a mechanical check, until the check passes and the manager agrees. Stuck rounds escalate to the supervisor. Best for a change or a program with something that can check it."
 :input-schema [:map [:branch :map] [:turn :int]]

 :progress [:plan :ideate :manage :work :test :unstick :verify]

 :cells {:start   :loop/assemble
         :plan    :team-solve/plan
         :ideate  :team-solve/ideate
         :manage  :team-solve/manage
         :work    :team-solve/work
         :test    :team-solve/test
         :unstick :team-solve/unstick
         :verify  :team-solve/verify
         :finish  :loop/finish}

 :edges {:start   :plan
         :plan    :ideate
         :ideate  :manage
         :manage  {:work :work :unstick :unstick :verify :verify}
         :work    :test
         :test    :manage
         :unstick {:work :work :verify :verify}
         :verify  :finish
         :finish  :end}

 :dispatches
 {:manage  [[:work    {:team-solve/go :work}]
            [:unstick {:team-solve/go :unstick}]
            [:verify  {:team-solve/go :verify}]]
  :unstick [[:work    {:team-solve/go :work}]
            [:verify  {:team-solve/go :verify}]]}}
